        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Of these, 801,351,354 shares are being offered by Anthropic and 23,648,646 shares are being offered by certain existing stockholders.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/roadshow-launch",
        "source": "Anthropic",
